  "title": "PPN 09/23: Updates to the Cyber Essentials Scheme",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/ppn-0923-updates-to-the-cyber-essentials-scheme",
  "description": "This PPN sets out the actions organisations should take to identify and mitigate cyber threats, along with resources to support implementation.",
